WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,767
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,167 --> 00:00:06,031
More and more empty cups pile up on Maya's counter... and she has only two hands!

3
00:00:06,731 --> 00:00:08,058
But look at the tall tower.

4
00:00:08,758 --> 00:00:09,895
It watches the cups.

5
00:00:10,595 --> 00:00:14,213
Its needle climbs... green... yellow... red!

6
00:00:14,613 --> 00:00:16,000
And the bell starts to swing.

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,447
Maya looks up.

8
00:00:18,147 --> 00:00:19,844
The tower is telling her something.

9
00:00:20,944 --> 00:00:21,571
Too busy!

10
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:23,828
So Maya opens a second stand.

11
00:00:24,928 --> 00:00:25,845
Now there are two!

12
00:00:26,245 --> 00:00:29,622
Both pitchers pour, and the cups fill up, one by one.

13
00:00:30,322 --> 00:00:33,783
The needle slides back down... yellow... green.

14
00:00:34,483 --> 00:00:35,510
The bell is quiet.

15
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,377
The tower smiles.

16
00:00:38,477 --> 00:00:43,284
That is CloudWatch: it watches your numbers and rings an alarm when something gets too busy.

17
00:00:43,984 --> 00:00:45,571
Check out the Cloud Town books.

18
00:00:46,271 --> 00:00:47,198
Link in the bio.

19
00:00:47,898 --> 00:00:48,885
See you next time!

